title: Tanakah
---
<<declare $tanakah_interaction_count = 0>>

<<if $tanakah_interaction_count == 0>>
 You: Hey Tanakah, how are you today?
 Tanakah: I'm going good! Just got off work.
 You: The people on TV are talking about the world ending. So everything will just be... gone?
 Tanakah: Yeah, I guess. It all ends someday kiddo...
 Tanakah: Y'know, I'd always thought it'd be loud or somethin'. Wars, bombs. That sorta thing. 
 Tanakah: But it's so quiet, like the world is just sighin'.
 Tanakah: Anyway, no time to waste now! Go off and see the world for the last time.
 Tanakah: If you find anything of sentimental value to others, I would love to see it.
 Tanakah: Or toast. I would also love toast.
 <<set $tanakah_interaction_count +=1>>
<<elseif $tanakah_interaction_count == 1>>
 <<if $numberOfToast> 0>>
  Give Tanakah toast?
  -> Yes
   You: Here, Tanakah! I made some fresh toast!
   Tanakah: Thanks, kiddo.
   // toast crunch sfx
   Tanakah: That's some good toast.
   <<set $numberOfToast -= 1>>
  -> No
 <<elseif $has_plant>>
  Give Haruka's plant to Tanakah?
  -> Yes
   You: Hey, Tanakah. Haruka gave me this succulent to give to someone. Would you like it?
   Tanakah: Of course, kiddo! That was so kind of Haruka.
  -> No
  <<set $gave_plant = true>>
 <<else>>
  Tanakah: No time to waste now, kiddo! Go off and see the world for the last time.
 <<endif>>
<<endif>>

===